    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1306 is a third-person story game where you play as a reactor maintenance bot labeled 1306, tasked with keeping the power plant from exploding. In this beginning chapter, it's up to 1306 to fix the reactor and prevent a total meltdown! However, they quickly learn that the task is more of a challenge than they initially thought... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/20ec7ac4335289078aef09931dc11043.poster.avif?t=1749045628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/20ec7ac4335289078aef09931dc11043.webm?t=1749045628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/20ec7ac4335289078aef09931dc11043.mp4?t=1749045628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The reactor is somehow drained and missing all three coolant rods. It's up to you to retrieve the rods from the warehouse and place them in the reactor's base before it can be filled back up!</strong> <br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/167ce257b43422a26b176849a0b3c2ee.poster.avif?t=1749045628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/167ce257b43422a26b176849a0b3c2ee.webm?t=1749045628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/167ce257b43422a26b176849a0b3c2ee.mp4?t=1749045628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey down to the warehouse to collect the rods!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/eb24611cf38b76710a162c86bcad12cd.poster.avif?t=1749045628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/eb24611cf38b76710a162c86bcad12cd.webm?t=1749045628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/eb24611cf38b76710a162c86bcad12cd.mp4?t=1749045628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With the help of your trusty wrench, get the lights on!</strong> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/e05182af1066d2a471cb0f70c58cacc7.poster.avif?t=1749045628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/e05182af1066d2a471cb0f70c58cacc7.webm?t=1749045628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/e05182af1066d2a471cb0f70c58cacc7.mp4?t=1749045628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep a good balance on your way!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/957be7e968b27afef7c57499f071696c.poster.avif?t=1749045628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/957be7e968b27afef7c57499f071696c.webm?t=1749045628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/957be7e968b27afef7c57499f071696c.mp4?t=1749045628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/e74dd4302738e80c94a13ff9a290704a.poster.avif?t=1749045628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/e74dd4302738e80c94a13ff9a290704a.webm?t=1749045628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/e74dd4302738e80c94a13ff9a290704a.mp4?t=1749045628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Most importantly! Prevent the place from being wiped off the map! </strong>   <br><strong>Good Luck, 1306!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br>Total playtime(100% playthrough): 25-35 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W,A,S,D or Up, Left, Right, Down Arrow for Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T: Equip Wrench/Battery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E:\u00a0 Interact with objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bF: Flashlight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Objective Screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spacebar: Skip cutscenes and dialog</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numpad*: Go into freecam mode</p>",
